<title>ROMANIA: Romanian producer prices 2.1 pct up in Oct.</title>
<headline>Romanian producer prices 2.1 pct up in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 2.1 percent in October on the previous month and by 61.6 percent year-on-year, National Statistics Board data showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	 OCT 96   SEPT 96   OCT 95</p>
<p>  mth/mth change		     +2.1     +4.0	+2.4</p>
<p>  extraction industry		+0.1     +0.6	+1.2</p>
<p>  processing industry		+2.5     +4.6	+2.8</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	  +0.3     +2.3	+0.1</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
